            <note corresp="#d350-f1" n="63" xml:id="d350-f1-content">
                <p>See memorandum of September 23, <ref target="frus1931-41v02#pg_634">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, vol. <hi
